---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Divider from '../components/Divider.astro';
---
<Base title={"Onboarding New Employees | Tangible Therapy"} description={""} noindex>
<section class="sec t-light h-small has-div" style="--divh:2vw">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:3;--mrows:3">
  <div class="b b-html je" style="--d:1/5/3/23;--m:1/2/4/10"><div class="rte"><div class="scaled"><span class="scaled-in"><h1>Onboarding a New Employee</h1></span></div></div></div>
</div>
</div>
<Divider type="wavy" height={2} width={20} fill="#fff" flipX flipY /></section>

<section class="sec t-white h-medium">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:18;--mrows:4">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/11/4/17;--m:1/2/3/10;z-index:2"><div class="rte"><h3 class="ta-center">Onboarding Steps</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:4/6/19/22;--m:3/2/5/10"><div class="rte"><p><a href="/reception-onboarding#googledrive">Set Up New Employee Folder in Google Drive</a></p><p><a href="/reception-onboarding#employment-contract">Send Employment Contract</a></p><p><a href="/reception-onboarding#gmailsetup">Create Gmail account and add to groups</a></p><p><a href="/reception-onboarding#onboarding">Send onboarding and orientation</a></p><p><a href="/reception-onboarding#driveandpayroll">Updating Google Drive &amp; Payroll Team</a></p><p><a href="/reception-onboarding#malpractice">Add to Malpractice Insurance</a></p><p><a href="/reception-onboarding#slack">Add to Slack</a></p><p><a href="/reception-onboarding#photos">Schedule head shots</a></p><p><a href="/reception-onboarding#supervision">Schedule Supervision</a></p><p><a href="/reception-onboarding#simple">Create Simple Practice Profile</a></p><p><a href="/reception-onboarding#availibility">Scheduling Availibility</a></p><p>Create Psychology Today Profile</p><p>Add to Website</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-light h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:9;--mrows:10">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/2/6/14;--m:1/2/5/10;z-index:2"><div class="rte"><h1>Create a Google Folder</h1></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:6/8/8/20;--m:5/2/11/10;z-index:3"><div class="rte"><ol><li><p>Go to the <a href="https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1DCzPfLaGhpOIepDvmZ0krxgQl61bahwN" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Employee Folder</a> on the drive</p></li><li><p>Click “new folder” in the top left corner</p></li><li><p>Label it with the first and last name of the employee</p></li></ol></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-light h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:19;--mrows:14">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/2/6/14;--m:1/2/5/10;z-index:2"><div class="rte"><h1>Send Employment Contract</h1></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:6/8/13/20;--m:5/2/11/10;z-index:3"><div class="rte"><ol><li><p>Go to the <a href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Lmh1aH0YbyRgcfuunFafXil00kQi1zLI" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Management Folder</a> on the drive</p></li><li><p>Right Click on the appropriate Employment Contract and “make a copy”</p></li><li><p>Update the Copy with relevant info, Name, pay, employment status, etc.</p></li><li><p>Download PDF</p></li><li><p>Send to the location supervisor for approval.</p></li><li><p>Send to the employee for signature</p></li><li><p>When the signed version is returned, save to Employees Google Drive folder.</p></li></ol></div></div>
  <div class="b b-marquee jc" style="--d:13/2/17/26;--m:11/2/13/10;z-index:4"><div class="marquee" aria-label="❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️"><div class="marquee-track"><span>❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span>❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span>❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span>❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span>❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span>❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span>❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span>❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span>❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span>❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span>❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><span>❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️ ❗️Stop, Do not Proceed❗️</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">✺</span></div></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:16/2/20/26;--m:13/2/15/10;z-index:5"><div class="rte"><h2 class="ta-center">Do NOT do any other steps until the employment contract is signed</h2></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-white-bold h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:14;--mrows:20">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/2/5/14;--m:1/2/5/10;z-index:2"><div class="rte"><h1>Setting Up Gmail</h1></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:5/7/12/21;--m:5/2/11/10;z-index:3"><div class="rte"><ol><li><p><span class="c-accent">Go to the </span><a href="https://admin.google.com/ac/home?hl=en" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><span class="c-accent">Google Admin Portal</span></a></p></li><li><p><span class="c-accent">Under the Users section, click “Add User”</span></p></li><li><p><span class="c-accent">Input the Employee’s name and use their first name as the email address. If that is already in use, use first name and first initial of their last name.</span></p></li><li><p><span class="c-accent">Input their current email address for secondary (set up) purposes</span></p></li><li><p><span class="c-accent">Click “add new user”</span></p></li></ol></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:12/4/13/12;--m:11/2/15/10;z-index:3"><div class="rte"><h3>Add to Google Groups</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:12/7/15/21;--m:15/2/21/10;z-index:4"><div class="rte"><ol><li><p><span class="c-accent">Once the email is setup, on the left hand side under the Directory tab, click “Groups”.</span></p></li><li><p><span class="c-accent">If you hover over the group you’d like to edit, an add members button will appear. click “add members”</span></p></li><li><p><span class="c-accent">Add the new employee to the appropriate groups based on location.</span></p></li></ol></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-light h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:21;--mrows:10">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/2/6/14;--m:1/2/5/10;z-index:2"><div class="rte"><h1>Send Onboarding and Orientation</h1></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:6/7/22/21;--m:5/2/11/10;z-index:3"><div class="rte"><p><strong>Copy and paste this message and send to the new employee. </strong></p><p><strong>Subject</strong>: Welcome to Tangible!</p><p>Hello (Employee Name)! </p><p>Welcome to the Tangible Team, we’re excited to have you on board. </p><p>To begin your process here with our team we need you to complete our orientation and onboarding process. Follow this process to do so: </p><ol><li><p>Follow this link our employee portal: <a href="/employeeportal">https://tangiblementalhealth.com/employeeportal</a></p></li><li><p>Use your new Tangible Email to sign up. You should have an email from google regarding this new account.</p></li><li><p>Click “Orientation” under “New Employee Links.” This section covers important info that will be relevant to your work at Tangible so please take the time necessary to comprehend what is taught. It may take an hour or so.</p></li><li><p>Once you’ve finished orientation, please complete “Onboarding,” also under “New Employee Links.” </p></li></ol><p>If you have questions don’t hesitate to reach out and we can help you through it. </p><p>When you have completed both Onboarding and Orientation. please reach out to your practice director to schedule a time to meet to complete the onboarding process. </p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-light h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:12;--mrows:10">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/2/6/14;--m:1/2/5/10;z-index:2"><div class="rte"><h1>Updating Drive and Payroll</h1></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:6/7/13/21;--m:5/2/11/10;z-index:3"><div class="rte"><ol><li><p>Once an employee has submitted their onboarding head to the <a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1i2OFTCSZUwcAvJD7pckJT0h9BPsUk2wvuAS0IjgjWZ8/edit?gid=0#gid=0" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Onboarding response</a> sheet.</p></li><li><p>Download all of the uploaded files and upload them to the employee’s <a href="https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1DCzPfLaGhpOIepDvmZ0krxgQl61bahwN" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google Drive</a> folder.</p></li><li><p>Compose an email to nsbcpayroll@gmail.com. </p></li><li><p>Ask them to please add the new employee to payroll. In the email include the employees name, pay rate and start date. Attach the W-4 and Direct Deposit pages you downloaded previously and send.</p></li></ol></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-light h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:10;--mrows:10">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/2/5/14;--m:1/2/5/10;z-index:2"><div class="rte"><h1>Add to Malpractice Insurance</h1></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:5/7/11/21;--m:5/2/11/10;z-index:3"><div class="rte"><ol><li><p>Head over to our <a href="https://www.insure-portal.com/User/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Malpractice providers site</a></p></li><li><p>Username: cleggbrady@gmail.com Password: (see the team password manager)</p></li><li><p>Click the “Make changes to my policy” button</p></li><li><p>Click “add something” then “add an employee”</p></li><li><p>Add the new employee and click save.</p></li></ol></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-light h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:7;--mrows:10">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/2/4/14;--m:1/2/5/10;z-index:2"><div class="rte"><h1>Add to Slack</h1></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:4/7/8/21;--m:5/2/11/10;z-index:3"><div class="rte"><ol><li><p>Open Slack</p></li><li><p>Click on Tangible Therapy on the top left</p></li><li><p>Click Invite member and add the employee using Tangible Email account.</p></li></ol></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-light h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:8;--mrows:10">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/2/6/14;--m:1/2/5/10;z-index:2"><div class="rte"><h1>Schedule Headshots</h1></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:6/7/9/21;--m:5/2/11/10;z-index:3"><div class="rte"><ol><li><p>Reach out to Julie and coordinate a time between Julie and the employee to take headshots.</p></li><li><p>Inform the employee that they should wear semi-professional attire, neutral colors that are not grey/black</p></li></ol></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-light h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:9;--mrows:10">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/2/6/14;--m:1/2/5/10;z-index:2"><div class="rte"><h1>Schedule Supervision</h1></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:6/7/10/21;--m:5/2/11/10;z-index:3"><div class="rte"><ol><li><p>Reach out to the locations practice director/supervisor and coordinate a time that fits for them and for the new employee to meet.</p></li><li><p>Create the calendar event in both calendars and set as a recurring appoinment.</p></li></ol></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-light h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:14;--mrows:10">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/2/6/14;--m:1/2/5/10;z-index:2"><div class="rte"><h1>Add to Simple Practice</h1></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:6/7/15/21;--m:5/2/11/10;z-index:3"><div class="rte"><ol><li><p>Got to <a href="https://secure.simplepractice.com/calendar/appointments" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Simple Practice</a></p></li><li><p>On the left hand side, go to settings, the in the left pop up menu select team, then team members.</p></li><li><p>Click Add new Team member in the top right.</p></li><li><p>Add them using their Legal Name and Tangible Email and hit continue.</p></li><li><p> In the next menu, select Clinician and select the “Full Client List” option and click continue.</p></li><li><p>Turn on all permissions and select continue. </p></li><li><p>If the employee needs supervision, select their supervisor from the dropdown. Under specialty select counselor.</p></li><li><p>Send invitation and complete setup.</p></li></ol></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-light h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:23;--mrows:16">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/2/6/14;--m:1/2/5/10;z-index:2"><div class="rte"><h1>Setting up availibility</h1></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:6/7/16/21;--m:5/2/11/10;z-index:3"><div class="rte"><ol><li><p>Got to <a href="https://secure.simplepractice.com/calendar/appointments" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Simple Practice</a></p></li><li><p>Navigate to the therapists calendar.</p></li><li><p>In the top right click the gear icon and then view availability schedule.</p></li><li><p>Click the time to add and add availability. Title the event Opening. The schedule should be found in <a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1i2OFTCSZUwcAvJD7pckJT0h9BPsUk2wvuAS0IjgjWZ8/edit?gid=0#gid=0" rel="noopener" target="_blank">onboarding responses</a></p></li><li><p>Ensure the right time is added and set as recurring for the days that match the time frame. Different time windows will have to be added individually.</p></li><li><p>Ensure the correct location is selected as well as that the telehealth box is checked.</p></li><li><p>Ensure the offered services match the ones shown below and then click save.</p></li><li><p>Repeat for additional times.</p></li></ol></div></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:16/9/24/19;--m:11/2/17/10;z-index:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--fit:contain"><img src="/images/screenshot-2025-11-24-at-3-57-40-pm-b0f670.png" alt="" width="858" height="570" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
